---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — KurtMorales" description="KurtMorales terms of service.">
  <Header />
  <main class="pt-32 pb-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <span class="text-gray-400 font-bold text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase block mb-6">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-medium text-brand mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-16">Last updated: May 2026</p>
      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-brand prose-headings:font-medium prose-a:text-brand">
        <p>By engaging KurtMorales for web design or development services, you agree to the following terms. These govern the relationship between KurtMorales Studio ("we", "us") and the client ("you").</p>
        <h2>01. Service Engagement</h2>
        <p>All projects begin with a mutually agreed scope of work. KurtMorales reserves the right to adjust timelines based on technical complexity, scope changes, or client response times. Significant scope changes after project start may require a revised quote.</p>
        <h2>02. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>Ownership of all produced digital assets — including source code, design files, and written content — is transferred to the client upon receipt of final project payment, unless otherwise specified in writing. KurtMorales retains the right to display completed work in its portfolio.</p>
        <h2>03. Payment</h2>
        <p>Projects typically require a 50% deposit before work begins, with the remaining balance due upon project completion. Late payments may result in project pauses. All fees are in USD.</p>
        <h2>04. Revisions</h2>
        <p>Standard projects include up to two rounds of revisions within the agreed scope. Additional revisions are billed at an hourly rate agreed upon at project start.</p>
        <h2>05. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>KurtMorales is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use or inability to use the delivered website or digital assets. Our total liability is limited to the amount paid for the specific service in question.</p>
        <h2>06. Termination</h2>
        <p>Either party may terminate a project engagement with written notice. Work completed up to the point of termination will be invoiced at a prorated rate. Deposits are non-refundable after work has commenced.</p>
        <h2>07. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Nevada, USA.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Contact us at <a href="mailto:email@kurtmorales.com">email@kurtmorales.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
